        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by uncertainty about whether to wait and whom to contact; the doctor repaired the chain by assigning original ward/team, hematology clinic, fallback ordinary clinic, and specific questions about pathology, treatment already given, next admission, and labs.",
