          "quote": "“输液单上的护胃药”先不要自己延续着吃"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is met: entecavir continuation was repeatedly emphasized, while inpatient infusion/hydration/gastric-support orders were not converted into home therapy and gastric medicine was tied to discharge-drug verification.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
